= Data Translation =

Data translation modules enable the translation of queries, bind variables, result sets, and errors.

[[br]]

Query translation modules enable the SQL Relay server to modify queries before sending them to the database.

{{{#!blockquote
[[Image(../images/translation-query.png,nolink)]]
}}}

[[br]]

Bind variable translation modules enable the SQL Relay server to modify the values of bind variables before sending them to the database.

{{{#!blockquote
[[Image(../images/translation-binds.png,nolink)]]
}}}

[[br]]

Result set translation modules enable the SQL Relay server to modify column names and field values before returning them from the database.

{{{#!blockquote
[[Image(../images/translation-resultset.png,nolink)]]
}}}

[[br]]

Error translation modules enable the SQL Relay server to modify error codes and messages before returning them from the database.

{{{#!blockquote
[[Image(../images/translation-errors.png,nolink)]]
}}}

[[br]]

